<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank calls off Friday bond auction.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank calls off Friday bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that it had cancelled its auction of 2.0 billion baht in bonds set for Friday.</p>
<p>It said the auction was cancelled because of the changing liquidity situation in the domestic market.</p>
<p>Money market dealers said liquidity was tight in the local market and there was no need for the central bank to mop up funds.</p>
</text>
